  "as_of": "2017-08-17",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would increase the tax calculation for superannuation contributions where a member's tax file number has not been quoted by the relevant year-end deadline.",
   "It would change the Medicare levy component from 2 per cent to 2.5 per cent in the formula applying to this category of contributions income.",
   "It would accompany the proposed Medicare levy increase in a wider package intended to help fund the Commonwealth's contribution to the National Disability Insurance Scheme."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The amended calculation would apply to assessments for the 2019-20 income year and later years.",
   "Commencement would align with the companion Medicare levy legislation.",
   "The levy component in paragraph 29(2)(b) of the Income Tax Rates Act 1986 would be updated."
  ],
  "affected": "Trustees of superannuation funds and retirement savings account providers would be affected.",
